    {
      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Embedding Source**\n\nI'm zeroing in on the architecture for `similarity_score.py`. OpenAI appears to be the most practical provider for text embedding and cosine similarity, and the code needs to explicitly reflect this choice. I will ensure that the dependency is clearly identified.\n\n\n**Clarifying the Implementation**\n\nI've decided to proceed by implementing a `cosine_similarity` function within `similarity_score.py`. It'll handle text input, leverage OpenAI's API for embedding generation, and then utilize NumPy to compute the cosine similarity score. I'll explicitly incorporate the OpenAI API key and model specification.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789866152371,
          "start": 1789866150769
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc560b710010xT0gp6aVwlkT7",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc5606920016mEeXWFRA5WutO",
      "session_id": "ses_f43a9f97affe0x34fxJxZC0N0r",
      "time_created": 1789866150769,
      "time_updated": 1789866152371
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "callID": "mZd8pc0a4iHAiJyd",
        "metadata": {
          "google": {
            "thoughtSignature": ""
          }
        },
        "state": {
          "input": {
            "content": "import openai\nfrom sklearn.metrics.pairwise import cosine_similarity\nimport numpy as np\nimport os\n\ndef get_embedding(text, model=\"text-embedding-ada-002\"):\n    openai.api_key = os.environ.get(\"OPENAI_API_KEY\")\n    if not openai.api_key:\n        raise ValueError(\"OPENAI_API_KEY environment variable not set.\")\n    client = openai.OpenAI()\n    text = text.replace(\"\\n\", \" \")\n    return client.embeddings.create(input=[text], model=model).data[0].embedding\n\ndef cosine_similarity_score(text1, text2):\n    embedding1 = get_embedding(text1)\n    embedding2 = get_embedding(text2)\n    return cosine_similarity(np.array(embedding1).reshape(1, -1), np.array(embedding2).reshape(1, -1))[0][0]\n",
            "filePath": "similarity_score.py"
          },
          "metadata": {
