      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Script's Purpose**\n\nI'm starting the process by nailing down the primary purpose: crafting a Python script, specifically `embed_batch.py`. It'll handle the task of generating embeddings for text batches, utilizing the `openai` library. My next step will be working on how to incorporate the library's functionality.\n\n\n**Specifying the Implementation**\n\nI've determined that `embed_batch.py` will use the `openai` library with the `text-embedding-ada-002` model for generating embeddings. Now I'm working on the initial structure of the Python script. I am planning on adding code to make that functionality accessible.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789866148002,
          "start": 1789866146119
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc55f947001t0b0OOUrK4T1IC",
